{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728<strong> Play  Demo First! </strong>\u2728 <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/899a731cefc94773b8a6cde54f07dda6.avif?t=1753791004\" alt=\"Sticker Shop Simulation\" /></div>\ud83d\udc31Sticker Business is a cozy mix of shop simulator and creative design game. Design and print charming stickers, collect and organize rare finds, and manage customer orders to grow your little sticker empire! Open mystery boxes and watch out for the cute thief cat!  <br>  <br> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.poster.avif?t=1753791004\" aria-label=\"Sticker Game\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.webm?t=1753791004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.mp4?t=1753791004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a cozy top-down sticker shop, you design and print unique stickers to fill your shelves. Collect new designs from mystery boxes, organize them neatly, and prepare orders for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your shop tidy and your customers happy to grow your reputation and unlock upgrades. But watch out \u2014 there\u2019s also a cute thief cat sneaking around, trying to nab your rarest stickers!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3889280?t=1753791004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/dbc1f67cc6417b5e62a8b0790e3a69deb3fd5fdd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753791004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/db1e45f3bf24a79c04db4fcf2a3b654399acb5be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753791004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/db1e45f3bf24a79c04db4fcf2a3b654399acb5be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753791004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728<strong> Play  Demo First! </strong>\u2728 <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/899a731cefc94773b8a6cde54f07dda6.avif?t=1753791004\" alt=\"Sticker Shop Simulation\" /></div>\ud83d\udc31Sticker Business is a cozy mix of shop simulator and creative design game. Design and print charming stickers, collect and organize rare finds, and manage customer orders to grow your little sticker empire! Open mystery boxes and watch out for the cute thief cat!  <br>  <br> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Gameplay</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.poster.avif?t=1753791004\" aria-label=\"Sticker Game\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.webm?t=1753791004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/extras/eb74da54d69267867d16a43bae29bc4a.mp4?t=1753791004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a cozy top-down sticker shop, you design and print unique stickers to fill your shelves. Collect new designs from mystery boxes, organize them neatly, and prepare orders for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your shop tidy and your customers happy to grow your reputation and unlock upgrades. But watch out \u2014 there\u2019s also a cute thief cat sneaking around, trying to nab your rarest stickers!</p>","developers":["Bubito"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889280/f4cccc782d537bdca665299a750ed50cd1ebb740/header.jpg?t=1753791004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170550,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170550/movie480.mp4?t=1753294908","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170550/movie_max.mp4?t=1753294908"},"name":"Sticker Business","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170550/ac7a4d9ed6d1e885be65a4d52712a59e4192f34a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753294908","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170550/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753294908","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170550/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753294908"}}],"name":"Sticker Business","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium CPU G860<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 840M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Bubito"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_fu